CSS Selector Practice

Demo page:
https://www.selenium.dev/selenium/web/locators_tests/locators.html

Use CSS selectors only:

1. Find the first-name field with "#fname" and verify its value is "Jane".
2. Find the last-name field with a selector that uses its class and ID; verify its value is "Doe".
3. Find the newsletter checkbox by its name and type; verify that it is initially unchecked.
4. Find the Female radio option by its type and value, click it, and verify that it is selected.
